### FILE
file_name: docker-compose.setup.yml
file_type: config
language_or_format: yaml
role: Docker Compose configuration for the DINS setup service. Defines the dins-setup container with volumes, networking, health checks, and resource limits.
used_by:
  - install/setup.sh
  - dinser setup command
depends_on:
  - Dockerfile.setup
status: active
notes: Mounts /opt/dins and Docker socket, uses dins-network bridge network.

